  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed gates, by reason of their contemporary design, would represent an incongruous form of development that would erode the original appearance of the host property. The scheme woud cause less than substantial harm to the Sheen Common Drive Conservation Area of which it forms part, and there are considered to be no public benefits to outweigh this harm. As such, the proposal would be contrary to the NPPF, and the Richmond Local Plan (2025), in particular policies 28 and 29, the House Extensions and External Alterations SPD as supported by the CA69 Sheen Common Drive Conservation Area Statement."
